      "content": "but the moment when the walls fall... that's when the nightmare actually starts. i don't want to be there to see it. i don't want to feel what happens next. if there is a way to control the end... a way to leave on my own terms before they get here... wouldn't that be more honorable than just waiting to be broken?",
